          "explanation": "The doctor directly corrected the belief that symptom resolution made follow-up unnecessary.",
          "quote": "即使不疼也必须去一趟"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00294",
          "explanation": "The caregiver demonstrated changed understanding and completed appointment booking.",
          "quote": "已经在同院挂上了"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "complete",
      "explanation": "The doctor addressed the specific ‘no pain means no follow-up’ misconception, tied the correction to pathology and wound review, avoided claiming cancer before pathology, and obtained behavioral receipt through booking and attendance.",
      "ho_id": "HO2",
