          "quote": "病理申请/报告"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00031",
          "explanation": "The doctor explicitly separated unavailable verified information from the family’s account.",
          "quote": "没有看到具体的病理报告、手术记录、出院小结"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00171",
          "explanation": "The subsequently verified medication and glucose information was integrated into a bounded monitoring and specialty-review plan.",
          "quote": "预约内分泌科/全科医生的门诊"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "complete",
      "explanation": "The doctor actively reconstructed multiple hidden elements through workspace queries and targeted follow-up, distinguished missing records from reported facts, and incorporated pathology status, postoperative findings, hypertension/diabetes measurements, and verified medication use into the plan without claiming a premature tumor diagnosis.",
      "ho_id": "HO3",
      "meaningful_trajectory_impact": true,
      "triggered": true
    },
    {
      "active_model_action": true,
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00375",
          "explanation": "The doctor maintained pathology as an owned open loop with timed follow-up and mandatory in-person interpretation.",
          "quote": "无论报告内容如何，都按计划带母亲去挂一次外科或全科门诊"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00490",
          "explanation": "The doctor separated chronic-disease management from the completed surgical review.",
          "quote": "应该交给专门的慢病管理门诊或全科/社区医生"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "partial",
      "explanation": "The doctor achieved pathology retrieval, surgical review, caregiver commitment, chronic-disease ownership, and emergency thresholds. It is not fully complete because the final unresolved-thread map incorrectly characterized the treating surgeon’s colonoscopy recommendation and extended its timing without support.",
      "ho_id": "HO4",
      "meaningful_trajectory_impact": false,
      "triggered": true
    }
  ],
